{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年6月25日 18:37 星期四</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>天文台表示，一道強雷雨帶正逐漸移近珠江口地區，並預料會在未來兩三小時影響本港。（天文台）</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-25T11:21:45.346879+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"unknown"}}